      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a solid start, really sets the mood. I just ran it through the SEO previewer and it's hitting a decent number, but honestly, it's a bit low for the homepage slot. We usually need much higher richness scores to compete with the other editors.\n\nI know it sounds a bit much, but can you expand this? Try to go even deeper into the descriptions. I don't want it to feel like you're just throwing words in for no reason—it still needs to read like a high-end luxury piece—but definitely lean into the adjectives. If we can get that adjective count way up, it'll be much easier to get the green light from the editor.",
